From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:16:18 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] wallet: submit persisted native payments and query
 transaction history

Maintenance explanation added during mailbox export:
Allow the native wallet to broadcast its persisted payment wire and query transaction history through the node provider. Provider and wallet tests cover submission and status plumbing; these interfaces depend on the coordinator for authoritative chain observations.

